flowchart LR
  subgraph Data[Reproducible synthetic data]
    Generator[20,000-row seeded generator]
    Split[Train 70% / Validation 15% / Held-out 15%]
    Generator --> Split
  end

  subgraph Risk[Stage A — calibrated risk scorer]
    XGB[XGBoost classifier]
    Calibrate[Validation-only sigmoid calibration]
    SHAP[SHAP feature contributions]
    Split --> XGB --> Calibrate --> SHAP
  end

  subgraph Evidence[Stage B — bounded evidence drafting]
    Retrieve[Retrieve structured transaction, delivery, communication, and history fields]
    Validate[Validate source-linked JSON claims]
    Claude[Claude Sonnet through server-side proxy]
    Retrieve --> Claude --> Validate
    Retrieve -. deterministic fallback .-> Validate
  end

  subgraph Service[FastAPI reference service]
    Score[/POST score/]
    Queue[/GET transactions + disputes/]
    Draft[/POST evidence generate/]
    Review[/POST evidence approve or reject/]
    Metrics[/GET metrics/]
    Audit[/GET audit-log/]
  end

  subgraph Control[Safety and accountability boundary]
    DB[(Persisted records)]
    Log[(Append-only UTC audit events)]
    Gate{Explicit human approval?}
    DB --> Log
    Review --> Gate
  end

  subgraph UI[Six-screen merchant dashboard]
    Dashboard[React + TypeScript + Tailwind + Recharts]
  end

  SHAP --> Score
  Validate --> Draft
  Score --> DB
  Queue --> DB
  Draft --> DB
  Review --> DB
  Metrics --> DB
  Audit --> Log
  Service --> Dashboard
  Gate -->|records local review state only| Log
  Gate -. no money movement / no external submission .-> Dashboard
